# Album photos live in Cloudflare R2 (synced by build.ps1 -Push), not in the
# repo. They are still generated locally under albums/<slug>/img/ as the sync
# source, but never committed - GitHub Pages cannot hold the collection at
# scale (see vinyl-site-multitenancy-design.md). One-time, to drop the copies
# already committed: `git rm -r --cached albums/*/img` (this does not reclaim
# history, it only stops future growth).
albums/*/img/
